Z||000046||JSocha||08-06-2001||01:58 AM||||Hey Cameron, welcome back to the forum.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Kinda wonderin if you were still around!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Anyways, babies are doin real fine.  Had the last colt on June 6th to which I haven't been able to post pics of.  Damn digital camera and scanner.<P>Took the Mustang away from the second born, Blaze, because her attitude was starting to rub off on him.  She and Dancer are out at our old house in the country grazing on the unmowed lawn.<P>Now we are taking Morning Star (first born) and Merrylegs (the last born) off of the mothers so we can work with them.<P>Merrylegs from day one has just been the friendliest little colt you can imagine.  We can do anything to him and he just wants more.  My youngest daughter can lay down with them and they will roll over on their backs just to have their stomachs rubbed.  Never thought a horse would do that, only dogs.  But they amaze us everyday.<P>Anyways, don't be a stranger bud! Glad to hear from you again.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
